OL,3,GNEWSAMen jailed over #70m tree-planting
OL,4,Ainvestment scam
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree men have been jailed over a
OL,7,Fmulti-million pound tree-planting scam
OL,8,Fthat cost 3,000 investors their
OL,9,Fworkplace pensions.
OL,11,FMatthew Pickard, 55, Stephen Greenaway,
OL,12,F46, and Paul Laver, 47, bought luxury
OL,13,Fcars and holidays from the profits of
OL,14,FBournemouth-based Ethical Forestry Ltd,
OL,15,Fwhich promised forestry investments in
OL,16,FCosta Rica.
OL,18,FThe firm took #70m from small investors
OL,19,Fbefore it collapsed in 2015, Southwark
OL,20,FCrown Court heard.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,334,330,200,160,0,100
